// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3359083951" "<color orange>The Circle mage claps his hands together when he sees you.</color><br><br>Yes, yes! You will do <i>nicely</i>. My name is Maharaj, and I would like to make an offer to you, {HeroName}.<br><br>You shouldn't be surprised that I know you, my friend. I make it my business to know everything that goes on in this morbid little corner of the world. I have information that you would find beneficial, I think, as well. No no, there is no price, no catch. I merely wish to impart my wisdom to you. And if the Circle should happen to benefit from your subsequent rampages...<br><br><color orange>Maharaj raises his hands before you, and shrugs.</color><br><br>I am merely here to look for a benefit in this place. If that cowardly mage told you otherwise, then he is wrong. You would be best to seek out a woman named <color yellow>Heather Townshend</color> if you're looking to solve this mystery of Dark Astoria.<br><br><color yellow>Maharaj is a repeatable mission giver in Dark Astoria. You can always get various missions from him. Enemies in these missions will reward incarnate experience and have a chance to drop incarnate threads. Completing a repeatable mission will give you a choice of either two incarnate threads, five reward merits, or a single super inspiration.</color>"

